      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK WARRIOR (1) was thereabouts on debut (24.52) at this track then improved nicely to get off the mark latest winning by 5.5 lengths (24.45) at this track. Looks to have an edge on most of these. DOLLAR SCIENCE (2) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (22.79) in a Mix 6/7 at Warrnambool over 390m. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Should be in this for a long way. MERRY MYRTLE (4) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Filled a minor placings again last time when third (20.78) at this track making it three placings in a row. Deserves a win and gets her chance. ASTON BENTLEY (8) was on the bunny all the way to win last start. Right in the mix again.",
